OL,3,GNEWSAExplosions warning as vehicles
OL,4,Ainvolved in scrapyard fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 40 firefighters have been
OL,7,Ftackling a scrapyard fire involving "a
OL,8,Flarge number of vehicles".
OL,10,FEssex County Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fwas called to Thornwood, Epping, at
OL,12,Fabout 07:23 BST and was joined by crews
OL,13,Ffrom Hertfordshire Fire and Rescue
OL,14,FService.
OL,16,FNearby residents have been advised to
OL,17,Fkeep their windows and doors closed
OL,18,Fbecause of gases from the fire.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
