OL,3,GNEWSAExplosions warning as vehicles
OL,4,Ainvolved in scrapyard fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said people should not
OL,7,Fbe alarmed by explosions, which were
OL,8,Fexpected because vehicles were
OL,9,Finvolved, but were contained within the
OL,10,Fsite.
